sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Prepare and maintain the items
    %% Stories: 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 14, 15, 31
    %% Description: The moderator starts a round with an item, imports further items and adds, edits or deletes items. Moderator and estimators see the items of the round.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor EP as Estimator (person)
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item

    %% covers 3
    M->>G: start round with an item
    G->>R: new round
    R->>I: item
    %% covers 14, 15
    M->>R: import items
    %% covers 6, 7, 8
    M->>R: add, edit or delete an item
    R->>I: changed items
    %% covers 4
    M->>R: view all items
    %% covers 31
    EP->>R: view all items
